    "updated_at": "2026-11-10T02:46:20Z",
    "body": "Review note for the maintainer. The orientation numbers here are read in the **front-tool** frame (the built-in Lathe; the Fanuc Lathe writes no number to the control), and the physical offsets are right for it. PathPilot (rear tool, X+ toward the tool) numbers the same OD tool **3**. The mirrored numbering is filed as https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/issues/650. It must land before #626 or the Tormach lathes rely on orientation numbers; it does not change this PR's front-lathe output.",
